"""Mostly an orthographic `ret` detector, with graded responses to its words.

The strongest negatives mark `ret`, retirement, and 退 (withdraw/retire).
Longer retention/retail/retrieval words are weaker. A suffix completing one
of these words also responds. Independently, 9 inside a number is negative.
All other tokens are approximated by zero; state resets at document changes.
