"""A lexical detector for duct/duce, construction, conclusion and interruption.

It recognizes visible stems, their grammatical endings, and split word pieces;
this is not a sentence-level semantic judgment. Related Chinese/Japanese
characters for leading, pulling, breaking and concluding also respond.
The only cross-word response is a small echo on a following 'of'.
